        "title": "Binomial Coefficients and Identities",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   ALGEBRAIC                COMBINATORIAL              ALGEBRAIC (series)\n   C(n,k) = n!/(k!(n-k)!)   = # of k-subsets of [n]   = [x^k] (1+x)^n\n        |                          |                        |\n        +--------------------------+------------------------+\n                       all three are the SAME number\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-BINOMIAL-AND-IDENTITIES.md#007",
      "path": [
        "02-BINOMIAL-AND-IDENTITIES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
